Package: citronics-usb-network
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Citronics <info@citronics.eu>
Depends: iproute2
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: USB network link of Citronics phones, unique per device
 Derives the address of the phone's USB network link (usb0), the address
 its DHCP server hands the computer, and the link's MAC from the eMMC
 serial: a /30 in 10.250.0.0/16, so that phones connected to the same
 computer never clash. Configures isc-dhcp-server or dnsmasq, whichever
 serves the link.
